Homepage: https://github.com/ogden-marrow/tech2-cardwriter-linux
Description: modern Linux front-end for Tech 2 Card Writer
 Tech2 Card Writer wraps the freeware Windows Tech 2 Card Writer in a
 private Wine runtime, detects USB serial adapters, validates Saab/GM
 card images, and launches the writer with a guided checklist.
 .
 It writes Tech 2 PCMCIA card images only. It does not program ECUs and
 is not a replacement for TIS2000 or SPS.
